 "id": "324169743635280", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/86620220_324169746968613_7117931673492806532_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=J-zGTYTsHpIQ7kNvwFFCMZr&_nc_oc=Adp3ZVFPT_9uR5Lq2tnwdTvTdkZvxcFflkTH2lH6Qm1c2wUl8gzzko2RugF3mJFK4lk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_bFLcUBYp08Du0s-Q2A8diim4OIKF6BFuZ-IvzZtR5cw&oe=6A3BD527"}, {"file_name": "Landscape.png", "id": "284554587659447", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974709_284554590992780_5763669827891232699_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iKe_bvFI8OoQ7kNvwE7VIPC&_nc_oc=AdoH1W-p6Kch_fw1LurcyJeoukXCeuiEEodnLl7WB5bus5bmzxVqKz226SG4yEgM3rw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_CgOjecpM0GxzjWCR-_7YpvMns5qL95jbk9ixSgGWJkg&oe=6A3BCC04"}, {"file_name": "Landscape.png", "id": "677824147318518", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/54823267_677824150651851_3688777864047447478_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Jji6bkzO0owQ7kNvwHRs0Oy&_nc_oc=AdpDSXMttxg3ft5JSnGFvdv5jLtZImIrjtYxIrnsWvw8-RO84CyLl3W4n_98x0VOoBQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9H6dYe4yM7LjS2i0fqlPJdVIldWdRDzJWpui3ixcZEdA&oe=6A3BD2EE"}, {"file_name": "Landscape.png", "id": "329704216222612", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75250460_329704219555945_6993099148500521476_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ONuBwS238dgQ7kNvwHLorB1&_nc_oc=AdoThVzSjsctMCxTFechI8uK3PxTU0zLmduzfUIVxT7GFSg0WUKU9kU8Rlsvi9-si40&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8KOJ11eqgV_QKbkfW2q0NxLOO9VPBdK9jOMBXZutwbrg&oe=6A3BDCD3"}, {"file_name": "Landscape.png", "id": "627211022861814", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031653_627211026195147_859210511188470322_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qUfjc6jjUpAQ7kNvwFggGOP&_nc_oc=AdrW6H31ZrhDrj3cJc8pO5u7qA_IBHjMBW52jYRH8sGy2jcM8HXQvWMAQY3d5tu0Nm0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8xe8_wu6ln0ICyBqFTZMlQiwC01BTgkoksA-vX_5O_MQ&oe=6A3BD728"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "VRLegs", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Welcome to \"VRLegs\", where the thrill of parkour meets the immersive world of virtual reality. Step into a realm where your movements are fluid, intuitive, and empowering. Our state-of-the-art locomotion system redefines how you move, jump, and traverse in the VR space, offering an unparalleled sensation of freedom.\n\nChallenge friends or team up in heart-pounding multiplayer tag matches. Navigate complex terrains, leap across buildings, and experience the exhilaration of real-time chases. As you master your environment, you'll discover new strategies, shortcuts, and moves to stay one step ahead or elude capture.\n\nWhether you're a parkour enthusiast or new to the world of VR, \"VRLegs\" promises an adrenaline-pumping experience like no other. Join the revolution, find your rhythm, and let the chase begin!", "short_description": "Unleash parkour prowess in \"VRLegs\"! Dive into multiplayer tag, powered by a groundbreaking VR locomotion system. Feel the rush!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://vrlegs.xyz/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "ForkingVR", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://vrlegs.xyz/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "suppo